OL,3,GNEWSAManhunt under way after three
OL,4,Ainjured in stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police manhunt is under way after
OL,7,Fthree people were injured in a stabbing
OL,8,Fin Borough Green.
OL,10,FKent Police said armed officers were
OL,11,Fcalled to a property in Sevenoaks Road
OL,12,Fat about 07:40 BST following reports of
OL,13,Fa domestic incident.
OL,15,FOne man has been taking to a London
OL,16,Fhospital with life threatening
OL,17,Finjuries. A second man has been taken
OL,18,Fto a local hospital, while a woman
OL,19,Fsustained minor arm injuries, they
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
